{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56570","headline":"火记歌（幷序） 十二 · 韩蕴中","name":"火记歌（幷序） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上六居坤位，阴阳括始终。\n帝男精作髓，离女血殷红。\n二八当交合，三人义不同。\n开鑪看至宝，服即变衰翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩蕴中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}